#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:217
msgid "Whitespace Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:218
msgid ""
"**Cinematic breathing room between sections**: Massive vertical gaps "
"create a \"scroll-through-chapters\" experience — each section feels like"
" a new scene."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:219
msgid ""
"**Dense within components**: Cards and code blocks are internally "
"compact, with tight line-heights and controlled padding. Information is "
"concentrated, not spread thin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:220
msgid ""
"**Border-defined separation**: Rather than relying solely on whitespace, "
"VoltAgent uses the Warm Charcoal border system (`#3d3a39`) to delineate "
"content zones. The border IS the whitespace signal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:221
msgid ""
"**Hero-first hierarchy**: The top of the page commands the most space — "
"the \"AI Agent Engineering Platform\" headline and npm command get "
"maximum vertical runway before the first content section appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:223
msgid "Border Radius Scale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:224
msgid ""
"Nearly squared (4px): Small inline elements, SVG containers, code spans —"
" the sharpest treatment, conveying technical precision"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:225
msgid ""
"Subtly rounded (6px): Buttons, links, clipboard actions — the workhorse "
"radius for interactive elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:226
msgid ""
"Code-specific (6.4px): Code blocks, `pre` elements, clipboard copy "
"targets — a deliberate micro-distinction from standard 6px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:227
msgid ""
"Comfortably rounded (8px): Content cards, feature containers, emphasized "
"buttons — the standard containment radius"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:228
msgid ""
"Pill-shaped (9999px): Tags, badges, status indicators, pill-shaped "
"navigation elements — the roundest treatment for small categorical labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:230
msgid "6. Depth & Elevation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Level"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Treatment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Flat (Level 0)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "No shadow, no border"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Page background (`#050507`), inline text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Contained (Level 1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "`1px solid #3d3a39`, no shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Standard cards, nav bar, code blocks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Emphasized (Level 2)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "`3px solid #3d3a39`, no shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Large interactive buttons, emphasized containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Accent (Level 3)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "`2px solid #00d992`, no shadow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Active/highlighted feature cards, selected states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Ambient Glow (Level 4)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "`rgba(92, 88, 85, 0.2) 0px 0px 15px`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Elevated cards, hover states, soft atmospheric lift"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Dramatic Float (Level 5)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 0px 20px 60px` + `rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1) 1px inset`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md
msgid "Hero feature showcase, modals, maximum-elevation content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:241
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: VoltAgent communicates depth primarily through "
"**border weight and color**, not shadows. The standard `1px solid "
"#3d3a39` border IS the elevation — adding a `3px` border weight or "
"switching to green (`#00d992`) communicates importance more than adding "
"shadow does. When shadows do appear, they're either warm and diffused "
"(Level 4) or cinematic and dramatic (Level 5) — never medium or generic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:243
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:244
msgid ""
"**Green Signal Glow**: The VoltAgent bolt logo pulses with a `drop-"
"shadow` animation cycling between 2px and 8px blur radius in Emerald "
"Signal Green. This is the most distinctive decorative element — it makes "
"the logo feel \"powered on.\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:245
msgid ""
"**Warm Charcoal Containment Lines**: The warm tone of `#3d3a39` borders "
"creates a subtle visual warmth against the cool black, as if the cards "
"are faintly heated from within."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:246
msgid ""
"**Dashed Workflow Lines**: `1px dashed rgba(79, 93, 117, 0.4)` creates a "
"blueprint-like aesthetic for architecture diagrams, visually distinct "
"from solid content borders."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:248
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:250
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:251
msgid ""
"Use Abyss Black (`#050507`) as the landing page background and Carbon "
"Surface (`#101010`) for all contained elements — the two-shade dark "
"system is essential"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:252
msgid ""
"Reserve Emerald Signal Green (`#00d992`) exclusively for high-signal "
"moments: active borders, glow effects, and the most important interactive"
" accents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:253
msgid ""
"Use VoltAgent Mint (`#2fd6a1`) for button text on dark surfaces — it's "
"more readable than pure Signal Green"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:254
msgid ""
"Keep heading line-heights compressed (1.0–1.11) with negative letter-"
"spacing for dense, authoritative text blocks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:255
msgid ""
"Use the warm gray palette (`#3d3a39`, `#8b949e`, `#b8b3b0`) for borders "
"and secondary text — warmth prevents the dark theme from feeling sterile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:256
msgid ""
"Present code snippets as primary content — they're hero elements, not "
"supporting illustrations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:257
msgid ""
"Use border weight (1px → 2px → 3px) and color shifts (`#3d3a39` → "
"`#00d992`) to communicate depth and importance, rather than relying on "
"shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:258
msgid ""
"Pair system-ui for headings with Inter for body text — the "
"speed/authority of native fonts combined with the precision of a "
"geometric sans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:259
msgid ""
"Use SFMono-Regular for all code content — it's the developer credibility "
"signal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:260
msgid "Apply `\"calt\"` and `\"rlig\"` OpenType features across all text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:262
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:263
msgid ""
"Don't use bright or light backgrounds as primary surfaces — the entire "
"identity lives on near-black"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:264
msgid ""
"Don't introduce warm colors (orange, red, yellow) as decorative accents —"
" the palette is strictly green + warm neutrals on black. Warm colors are "
"reserved for semantic states (warning, error) only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:265
msgid ""
"Don't use Emerald Signal Green (`#00d992`) on large surfaces or as "
"background fills — it's an accent, never a surface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:266
msgid ""
"Don't increase heading line-heights beyond 1.33 — the compressed density "
"is core to the engineering-platform identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:267
msgid ""
"Don't use heavy shadows generously — depth comes from border treatment, "
"not box-shadow. Shadows are reserved for Level 4–5 elevation only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:268
msgid ""
"Don't use pure white (`#ffffff`) as default body text — Snow White "
"(`#f2f2f2`) is the standard. Pure white is reserved for maximum-emphasis "
"headings and button text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:269
msgid ""
"Don't mix in serif or decorative fonts — the entire system is geometric "
"sans + monospace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:270
msgid ""
"Don't use border-radius larger than 8px on content cards — 9999px (pill) "
"is only for small tags and badges"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:271
msgid ""
"Don't skip the warm-gray border system — cards without `#3d3a39` borders "
"lose their containment and float ambiguously on the dark canvas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:272
msgid ""
"Don't animate aggressively — animations are slow and subtle (25–100s "
"durations for marquee, gentle glow pulses). Fast motion contradicts the "
"\"engineering precision\" atmosphere"
msgstr ""

