msgid "Focus on ONE component at a time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:331
msgid ""
"Reference specific color names and hex codes — \"use Warm Parchment "
"(#b8b3b0)\" not \"make it lighter\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:332
msgid ""
"Use border treatment to communicate elevation: \"change the border to 2px"
" solid Emerald Signal Green (#00d992)\" for emphasis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:333
msgid ""
"Describe the desired \"feel\" alongside measurements — \"compressed and "
"authoritative heading at 36px with line-height 1.11 and -0.9px letter-"
"spacing\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_voltagent.md:334
msgid ""
"For glow effects, specify \"Emerald Signal Green (#00d992) as a drop-"
"shadow with 2–8px blur radius\""
